                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Experienced on the Oculus Rift with Keyboard & Mouse then Xbox controller. VR only review. [/h1]\n\nI'm looking at the store page video and wondering where is that game. None of that happened on my VR gameplay. I waited and waited for 10 minutes and nothing happened until the 10 minutes were over and then out of nowhere this ghost came and jump scared me. Game over. Keyboard & mouse played a little better than Xbox controller.\n\nI looked all around. I had several pathing issues. I got stuck on the stairs. There were several closets I couldn't open. But the biggest problem is that I think there's suppposed to be several things chasing you and you have to run to the closet to hide from them and turn off your flashlight, but none of that happened. I experienced zero game. The game is completely broken in VR.\n\nRate 2/10. This is about as bad as games get. Maybe test out your game before releasing it on Steam?",
